#: donate/views.py:1333
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Thank you for your generous donations to the GNOME Foundation in %(year)s. "
"Your contributions were as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Tack för dina generösa donationer till GNOME Foundation under %(year)s. Dina "
"bidrag var:"

#: donate/views.py:1341
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Datum"

#: donate/views.py:1341
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Belopp"

#: donate/views.py:1359
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Summa"

#: donate/views.py:1392
msgid ""
"Your support helps us continue our mission to create a free and open "
"computing platform for the general public. Thank you for being a part of the "
"GNOME community."
msgstr ""
"Ditt stöd hjälper oss att fortsätta vårt uppdrag att skapa en fri och öppen "
"datorplattform för alla. Tack för att du är en del av GNOME-gemenskapen."

#: donate/views.py:1406
msgid "President"
msgstr "President"

#: donate/views.py:1407 templates/gnome/includes/footer.html:8
